'''''Thuidium delicatulum''''', also known as the '''delicate fern moss'''{{r|ou}} or '''common fern moss''',{{r|ilwild}} is a widespread species of [[moss]] in the family [[Thuidiaceae]]. It is found in North and South America from [[Alaska]] to Brazil.<ref>{{Cite web|url=http://www.tropicos.org/Name/35105536?tab=distribution|title=Tropicos {{!}} Name - !Thuidium delicatulum (Hedw.) Schimp.|website=www.tropicos.org|access-date=2020-01-11}}</ref>

